  (b) restated: restores the OLD DISPATCH  -> M_OLD 15/48   (the literal clause is
                                              unsatisfiable here, as recorded above)
  (c) null medium                          -> HEAD 15/48
  (d) NULLED REPAIR                        -> M_NULL 22/48

